BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:【FHTM】院長講座：博士生涯規劃藍圖
DTSTART:20261014T023000Z
DTEND:20261014T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T005519Z
UID:urn:uuid:c357105a-2e2e-537e-b35f-cb0dac0aa7b0
DESCRIPTION:活動簡介/Description： 酒店與旅遊管理學院誠邀
 博士一年級同學出席「院長講座：博士生涯規劃藍圖」
 。本次講座由院長吳國民教授主講，旨在為博士生提供
 全面的學術與職業生涯規劃指導。吳院長將分享寶貴經
 驗，協助學生釐清研究方向，為未來的學術道路與職業
 發展奠定堅實基礎。/The Faculty of Hospitality and Tourism Managem
 ent cordially invites first-year doctoral students to the “Dean’s Talk
 : Doctoral Road Map”. Hosted by Professor Ben K. Goh\, Dean of the Facul
 ty\, this talk aims to provide comprehensive guidance on academic and care
 er planning for doctoral students. Professor Goh will share his valuable e
 xperience to help students clarify their research directions and lay a sol
